title_en:
An AI agent’s spending limit shouldn’t live in a prompt.

@0xsachi tells @TheStreet why it belongs in the wallet layer instead, on open infrastructure anyone can verify rather than a platform you have to trust.

Read more: https://www.thestreet.com/technology/ai-agents-growing-role-in-payments-raises-an-awkward-question

